cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "WAVE Methodology — Workflow Amplification via Vectored Expertise"
message: "If you use WAVE in your work, please cite it as below."
abstract: >-
  WAVE is an open methodology for human-AI collaboration.
  It provides a three-layer framework (DataPrep, Prompt2Data, Prompt2Prompt)
  that amplifies human expertise through structured AI collaboration.
  The foundational principle is 70/30: seventy percent human preparation,
  thirty percent AI execution. WAVE is domain-agnostic and applies to
  software engineering, healthcare, education, law, pharmaceutical research,
  engineering, and any field where humans work with AI.
